---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How Business Buyer collects, uses and protects your personal information."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container container--narrow">
      <p class="eyebrow">Privacy Policy</p>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="updated">Draft — last updated 5 November 2026</p>

      <p>
        Business Buyer ("we", "us", "our") respects your privacy. This policy explains, in plain English, what
        personal information we collect, how we use it, and the choices you have. It applies to information
        collected through this website, including when you submit your business for consideration.
      </p>

      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>When you submit your business through our website, we may collect:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Your name and email address</li>
        <li>Details about your business, including its industry, location and financial information you choose to share</li>
        <li>Any documents you choose to upload, such as financials or a pitch deck</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        We also collect general, non-identifying information about how visitors use our website, such as which
        pages are viewed, to help us understand and improve the site.
      </p>

      <h2>How we use your information</h2>
      <p>We use the information you provide to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Review and respond to your business submission</li>
        <li>Contact you about a potential acquisition</li>
        <li>Improve our website and the resources we provide</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We do not sell your personal information to third parties.</p>

      <h2>How we store and protect your information</h2>
      <p>
        We take reasonable steps to protect the personal information you share with us from misuse, loss, and
        unauthorised access. Submissions, including any documents you upload, are accessed only by people involved
        in reviewing your submission. We do not offer a formal confidentiality or non-disclosure arrangement as
        part of the submission process.
      </p>

      <h2>Sharing your information</h2>
      <p>
        We do not share your information with third parties except where necessary to assess or progress a
        potential acquisition (for example, with our own advisers), or where required by law.
      </p>

      <h2>Cookies and website analytics</h2>
      <p>
        Our website may use basic analytics tools to understand how visitors use the site. These tools may use
        cookies or similar technologies. You can control or disable cookies through your browser settings.
      </p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        You can ask us what personal information we hold about you, request corrections, or ask us to delete
        information we no longer need. If you've submitted your business and would like your information removed,
        please let us know and we will action your request.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        If you have questions about this Privacy Policy or how your information is handled, please get in touch via
        our <a href="/submit">submission form</a>.
      </p>

      <p class="draft-note">
        This is a draft policy provided as a starting point and has not yet been reviewed by a lawyer. Please review
        and have it checked before publishing.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .container--narrow {
    max-width: 720px;
  }

  .updated {
    color: var(--color-muted);
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  .draft-note {
    margin-top: 48px;
    padding-top: 20px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    font-style: italic;
  }
</style>
